{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31378","headline":"春愁 · 韩琮","name":"春愁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金乌长飞玉兔走，青鬓长青古无有。\n秦娥十六语如弦，未解贪花惜杨柳。\n吴鱼岭鴈无消息，水誓兰情别来久。\n劝君年少莫游春，煖风迟日浓於酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}